{"absolutePath":"/workspace/oss/hermes-desktop/lat.md/office-rendering-tests.md","content":"---\nlat:\n  require-code-mention: true\n---\n# Office rendering tests\n\nActual Office components must stop hidden frame scheduling, retain scene lifetime and resume visible animation without duplicate loops. The WebGL and external asset/API boundaries are synthetic.\n\n## Hidden pane stops frames\n\nAfter navigation away, frame counts remain unchanged. Repeated returns resume the same Canvas instance with at most one scheduled loop.\n\n## Background document stops frames\n\nDocument backgrounding pauses a selected Office. Becoming visible cannot restart an unselected pane; selecting Office again resumes its loop.\n\n## Hidden initial mount\n\nAn Office first mounted while the document is hidden schedules no frames until the document becomes visible.\n\n## Unmount cleans visibility owner\n\nUnmount removes the screen's exact visibility listener and cancels the frame scheduler, so later visibility events cannot revive it.\n","path":"office-rendering-tests.md","projectPath":"lat.md/office-rendering-tests.md","frontmatter":{"requireCodeMention":true},"sections":[{"id":"lat.md/office-rendering-tests#Office rendering tests","heading":"Office rendering tests","depth":1,"file":"lat.md/office-rendering-tests","filePath":"lat.md/office-rendering-tests.md","children":[{"id":"lat.md/office-rendering-tests#Office rendering tests#Hidden pane stops frames","heading":"Hidden pane stops frames","depth":2,"file":"lat.md/office-rendering-tests","filePath":"lat.md/office-rendering-tests.md","children":[],"startLine":9,"endLine":12,"firstParagraph":"After navigation away, frame counts remain unchanged. Repeated returns resume the same Canvas instance with at most one scheduled loop.","githubSlug":"hidden-pane-stops-frames"},{"id":"lat.md/office-rendering-tests#Office rendering tests#Background document stops frames","heading":"Background document stops frames","depth":2,"file":"lat.md/office-re